WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.780
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Your First Chat with an AI Assistant.

2
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:12.018
Ask a question, read the answer and ask a follow-up. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.017 --> 00:00:17.596
Step one. Open the AI assistant and click the message box at the bottom.

4
00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:24.570
Step two. Type a clear question. For example, explain what a folder is in simple English.

5
00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:32.177
Step three. Press Enter. Read the answer slowly. If you do not understand, you can ask again.

6
00:00:33.183 --> 00:00:41.750
Step four. Ask a follow-up. For example, give me an example, or make it shorter. A chat is a conversation, so keep talking.

7
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.575
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:50.070
Ask the AI to explain a word you do not know.

9
00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.847
Ask for an example.

10
00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:54.054
Ask it to make the answer shorter.

11
00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:55.471
Well done!

